   "text": "we took a trading education platform from idea to 12,000+ registered users in 8 weeks.\n\nAnthony (@_amtrades) came to us with one problem: his platform needed to convert free users to paid ones.\n\nso we built the whole thing from scratch.\n\nonboarding. a free dashboard with study tools. premium sections, locked states, and an upgrade journey we call the Expansion Model.\n\nWhop for memberships. Klaviyo for email after onboarding. a custom admin panel so he controls everything himself.\n\nand we built it to handle 100,000+ users from day one. because if it blows up, you don't want to rebuild it.\u20283 weeks later.\n\nAnthony now runs it completely on his own.\n\nhis words: \"I never had to ask for the same correction twice\"\n\nhttp://kargul.studio/work/am-trades",
